{"seq":40,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"0107338b-1e58-4f71-b125-29bac2b61ff6","runId":"run_1_1788436633481","result":"Done! I've saved the regex pattern to `/app/regex.txt`.\n\nThe regex pattern works as follows:\n\n- **`^(?=.*\\bIPV4\\b)`** — Ensures the line contains a valid IPv4 address (using positive lookahead)\n- **`.*?\\b(DATEPATTERN)\\b`** — Matches everything up to and captures a YYYY-MM-DD date, with word boundaries to prevent partial matches like \"user1234-12-25\"\n- **`(?!.*\\bDATEPATTERN\\b)`** — Negative lookahead ensuring no more dates follow on the same line, guaranteeing only the last date is captured\n\nThe IPv4 octet pattern `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9]?[0-9])` handles all values 0-255 without leading zeros. The date pattern allows months 01-12 and days 01-31 (including Feb 29), and word boundaries prevent false matches like \"1134-12-1234\" from being captured.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":117575,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0107338b-1e58-4f71-b125-29bac2b61ff6","total_cost_usd":0.08395585,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13243,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":12701,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":11799},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13243},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12300,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12300,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001248,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"